{"id":14350413280,"name":"[UPD] Ice Fishing Simulator 🐟","desc":"💎 Use code 'BLOODMOON' for 500 Gems\n🎃 HALLOWEEN: Blood Moon nights, a pumpkin patch and spooky new catches for a limited time!\n\n🐟 Catch, Collect, Cash In!\nDrill your ice hole and reel in fish of every rarity, including rare Albino, Gold and Void variants. Fill your coolers and sell at the Fish Market, where prices shift every in-game day.\n\n🔥 Cook Your Catch!\nCut fish into fillets and cook dishes on a grill or smoker for timed boosts. Discover new recipes in bottles you reel in!\n\n🛠️ Upgrade Everything!\nBetter rods, reels and lures, bigger coolers, and auto poles that fish for you. Tools and furnishings roll their own buffs, so chase the perfect roll!\n\n🏆 Daily Tournaments!\nCompete for the luckiest catch and the most fish caught each day to win trophies.\n\n🎨 Build Your Spot!\nDecorate around your ice hole with furnishings that boost your luck, and paint them with the Color Bar.\n\n🎉 +10% coins with a friend in your server, and +10% more for joining the group!","path":"/game/14350413280-ice-fishing-simulator","slug":"14350413280-ice-fishing-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8accaccf30967d92b7a8f7a186443ad924c5a32f291f75085eaaf59185c37716.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-857bc22c38705ca26645cc8c88d24819/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":319,"visitor":76485333,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-09-19T15:19:19.490Z","creator":{"name":"WildGuest Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"66ec40f7cd7b5985c752d5da","title":"Money Farm","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78083","gameId":14350413280,"name":"[UPD] Ice Fishing Simulator 🐟","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8accaccf30967d92b7a8f7a186443ad924c5a32f291f75085eaaf59185c37716.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-857bc22c38705ca26645cc8c88d24819/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"14350413280-ice-fishing-simulator","path":"/game/14350413280-ice-fishing-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8accaccf30967d92b7a8f7a186443ad924c5a32f291f75085eaaf59185c37716.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-857bc22c38705ca26645cc8c88d24819/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":14350413280},"slug":"UPD-Ice-Fishing-Simulator-Money-Farm-18624","verified":true,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":160497,"executes":796,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":true,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/25b1222c44aeb3fd342aa3086b55e5fb/500/280/Image/Jpeg","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/25b1222c44aeb3fd342aa3086b55e5fb/500/280/Image/Jpeg"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/25b1222c44aeb3fd342aa3086b55e5fb/500/280/Image/Jpeg","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/25b1222c44aeb3fd342aa3086b55e5fb/500/280/Image/Jpeg"},"likeCount":3,"dislikeCount":4,"createdAt":"2024-09-19T15:19:19.490Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-19T15:19:19.490Z","lastBump":"2024-09-19T15:19:19.490Z","script":"--First Script \nfor i,v in pairs(workspace.CaveObby.Stages:GetDescendants()) do \n    if v.Name == \"Lava\" or  v.Name == \"KillPart\" or  v.Name == \"SpikeLog\" then\n        v:Destroy()\n    end\nend\n\n--Second Script \nlocal TweenService = game:GetService(\"TweenService\")\nlocal player = game.Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal character = player.Character or player.CharacterAdded:Wait()\nlocal humanoidRootPart = character:WaitForChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\")\n\nlocal stages = {\n    workspace.CaveObby.Stages[\"1\"].Spawn,\n    workspace.CaveObby.Stages[\"2\"].Checkpoint,\n    workspace.CaveObby.Stages[\"3\"].Checkpoint,\n    workspace.CaveObby.Stages[\"4\"].Checkpoint,\n}\n\nlocal function tweenToPosition(position)\n    local tweenInfo = TweenInfo.new(1, Enum.EasingStyle.Sine, Enum.EasingDirection.InOut)\n    local goal = {CFrame = position.CFrame}\n\n    local tween = TweenService:Create(humanoidRootPart, tweenInfo, goal)\n    tween:Play()\n    tween.Completed:Wait() \nend\n\nwhile true do\n    for _, stage in ipairs(stages) do\n        if stage then\n            tweenToPosition(stage)\n            task.wait(1) \n        end\n    end\nend\n","features":"Hi just join execute the first script a couple times then the second script and get an Anti afk","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6227c42f7944271798ea1b15","username":"BeboMods","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2aa44350e3b5d4cb2aaffa5729675d006e73d3cebcfc1df90a01fe40b402064a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6227c42f7944271798ea1b15-1744552011109.jpeg"},"lvl":15,"status":"offline","id":"6227c42f7944271798ea1b15","leaderboard":{"tag":null},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.chart_topper","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2aa44350e3b5d4cb2aaffa5729675d006e73d3cebcfc1df90a01fe40b402064a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6227c42f7944271798ea1b15-1744552011109.jpeg"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-22T03:14:30.507Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e6b360710ec3c52223","editBy":{"_id":"6227c42f7944271798ea1b15","username":"BeboMods","status":"offline","id":"6227c42f7944271798ea1b15"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-03-27T23:06:24.747Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"66fea9d9c9d637cc9c10bbd2","commentBy":{"_id":"62b8862b51b002540b75bea8","username":"diego950121","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"createdAt":"2022-06-26T16:15:39.909Z","lastActive":"2026-02-17T14:20:50.923Z","status":"offline","id":"62b8862b51b002540b75bea8","